OL,3,APowerful earthquake hits Tibet killing
OL,4,A16 people, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA magnitude seven earthquake has hit a
OL,7,Fmountainous region in Tibet, killing at
OL,8,Fleast 16 people and injuring dozens of
OL,9,Fothers, according to Chinese state
OL,10,Fmedia reports.
OL,12,FThe centre of the quake hit Baqen
OL,13,FCounty in the Nagqu region as on
OL,14,FThursday night, Xinhua reported, citing
OL,15,Fthe local emergency management bureau.
OL,17,FThe county - located in what China
OL,18,Fcalls the Tibet Autonomous Region after
OL,19,Fannexing it in the 1950s - is 400km
OL,20,Fnorth-east of the region's capital,
OL,21,FLhasa.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
