OL,3,APowerful earthquake hits Tibet killing
OL,4,A16 people, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthorities have declared an emergency
OL,7,Fand deployed rescue teams to the
OL,8,Faffected area, where 32 others have
OL,9,Falso been injured.
